{"words": [{"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "كَفَرُوا۟", "translation": "disbelieve[d]"}, {"text": "سَوَآءٌ", "translation": "(it) is same"}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِمْ", "translation": "to them"}, {"text": "ءَأَنذَرْتَهُمْ", "translation": "whether you warn them"}, {"text": "أَمْ", "translation": "or"}, {"text": "لَمْ", "translation": "not"}, {"text": "تُنذِرْهُمْ", "translation": "you warn them"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "not"}, {"text": "يُؤْمِنُونَ", "translation": "they believe"}], "sahih": "Indeed, those who disbelieve1 - it is all the same for them whether you warn them or do not warn them - they will not believe."}